<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar, gains on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling steady on dollar, gains on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained unchanged against the dollar but gained on the pound sterling, the central Bank of Tanzania said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 624.6900 unchanged against Friday's close. Against the pound, the shilling exchanged at 1053.4179 against Friday's 1054.0098.</p>
</text>
